ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 700.15771653543311 Td
(by a single processor in a reasonable amount of time. Scientific simulations — such as climate) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 683.1498425196850803 Td
(modeling, protein folding, and astrophysical simulations — require processing enormous volumes) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 666.1419685039369369 Td
(of data. Parallel and distributed systems make such computations feasible by dividing the workload.) Tj
ET
