/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 615.1183464566928478 Td
(One of the most fundamental motivations is speed. By dividing a problem into parts that can be) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 598.1104724409448181 Td
(processed simultaneously, we can significantly reduce the total execution time. For example, a) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0 g
56.6929133858267775 581.1025984251967884 Td
(weather forecast that might take 48 hours on a single machine can be completed in minutes using) Tj
